================================================================================
3. OCaml sources in this repository
================================================================================

No third-party OCaml source is vendored, copied, or derived. Every OCaml
library listed in section 4 is an original implementation written for dio and
is covered by this repository's LICENSE. The only third-party software in the
build is the native set described in sections 2 and 5 and the compiler
toolchain described in section 1.

================================================================================
4. In-tree OCaml libraries
================================================================================

These libraries are built from source in this repository (src/foundation/) and
statically linked into dio, dio-dashboard and dio-oracle. No OCaml library is
linked from opam; the compiler runtime is the external toolchain component.
The remaining native dependencies are libsecp256k1, OpenSSL and the prebuilt
Lighter Go signer, covered in section 2 and used through bindings under
src/foundation/crypto/.

The libraries are: dio.lwt, dio.lwt.unix, dio.digestif, dio.base64,
dio.mtime, dio.msgpck, dio.yojson, dio.json_scan, dio.uutf, dio.uri,
dio.ipaddr, dio.conduit-lwt-unix, dio.cohttp, dio.cohttp-lwt,
dio.cohttp-lwt-unix, dio.websocket, alcotest, dio.mirage-crypto-rng,
dio.notty, dio.ssl, dio.lwt_ssl, dio.secp256k1 and dio.lighter_ffi.

The secp256k1 binding in src/foundation/crypto/secp256k1 and the Go-signer binding in
src/foundation/crypto/lighter_ffi are original code written for dio. The native
libsecp256k1 and the prebuilt Lighter Go signer are covered in section 2. The
alcotest harness is test-only and is not installed.

Build-, test-, and documentation-only dependencies that are not shipped:
dune (MIT), dune-configurator (MIT), odoc (ISC).

Full texts: MIT, ISC, BSD-2-Clause and BSD-3-Clause are in section 6.


================================================================================
5. Container base OS and runtime system libraries
================================================================================

Build base image: Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (ocaml/opam, pinned by digest).
Runtime image: Ubuntu 24.04 LTS (pinned by digest).

Runtime packages installed into the image: libssl3t64, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1,
libjemalloc2, ca-certificates, netbase. libsecp256k1 is built from source in the
base stage and copied into the runtime image (section 2.2). The Go Lighter
signer is the prebuilt shared library described in section 2.1.

These are unmodified Ubuntu packages. Each package's copyright and license text
is installed by the distribution at /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright inside
the image. Principal licenses:

  libssl3t64       Apache-2.0
  libstdc++6       GPL-3.0-or-later with GCC runtime exception
  libgcc-s1        GPL-3.0-or-later with GCC runtime exception
  libjemalloc2     BSD-2-Clause
  ca-certificates  MPL-2.0
  netbase          GPL-2.0


